Provenance
----------
Derived from gtk-frdp (https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gtk-frdp), commit
83854a2 (2026-07-24). Upstream's COPYING file is LGPL-3.0, but its source
files carry GPL-3.0-or-later headers; this project follows the per-file
GPL-3.0-or-later notices.

Upstream copyright holders (notices kept in each file):
  Felipe Borges, Marek Kasik, Armin Novak; further contributions to the
  files used by Ondrej Holy, Martin Blanchard, Jason Gerecke and others
  (see `git log 83854a2 -- src`).

Changes since upstream (Copyright (C) 2026 mFat):
  - GTK4 port of FrdpDisplay and FrdpSession (event controllers,
    snapshot()/GdkMemoryTexture rendering, GTK4 cursors and shortcuts
    inhibition); FreeRDP 3 only; clipboard optional.
  - Per-session worker thread owning FreeRDP; prompts answered without a
    nested main loop; non-blocking close.
  - Fixes: widget/session/FreeRDP-context leaks, use-after-free after a
    failed connect, hang on synchronously answered certificate prompts,
    stalled network processing for hidden widgets.

Design references (no code copied): Remmina's RDP plugin (GPL-2.0-or-later
with OpenSSL exception) and FreeRDP's SDL3 client (Apache-2.0) for the
session-thread model; CoffeeRDP (Apache-2.0) was reviewed.

Runtime dependencies: FreeRDP 3 / WinPR 3 (Apache-2.0), GTK 4 and GLib
(LGPL-2.1-or-later), OpenSSL 3 via FreeRDP (Apache-2.0) — all compatible
with GPL-3.0-or-later.
